    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the unique adventure of <strong>The Memory Thieves</strong>, a cooperative multiplayer game where 1 to 4 players take on the role of memory thieves. Explore the mysterious portals of <strong>Ravenwood</strong> Cemetery and steal forgotten treasures while avoiding hidden dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/b15d0776545329cf587c6ca55409103c.poster.avif?t=1753891128\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/b15d0776545329cf587c6ca55409103c.webm?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/b15d0776545329cf587c6ca55409103c.mp4?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative multiplayer</strong>: Play alone or form a team of four thieves to maximise your chances of success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation</strong>: Each memory is procedurally generated, offering a unique experience every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:</strong> An intense challenge where failure is an essential part of learning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bestiary:</strong> A wide variety of enemies, each with their own behaviors and unique threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics and atmosphere</strong>: Enjoy semi-realistic graphics and a heavy, serious atmosphere that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression system</strong>: Gain experience to level up and unlock new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed objects</strong>: Thwart the curses of cursed rooms and objects that can negatively affect players, but which contain treasures of great value.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive soundtrack</strong>: A simple but effective soundtrack that reinforces the mysterious atmosphere of the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HISTORY AND UNIVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena are occurring in <strong>Ravenwood</strong> cemetery, revealing portals that lead to the memories of the dead. Groups of intrepid thieves see this as a unique opportunity to recover priceless treasures. But beware, for these places are well guarded by souls from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/2dd5559028843e19e20126e69a063595.poster.avif?t=1753891128\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/2dd5559028843e19e20126e69a063595.webm?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/2dd5559028843e19e20126e69a063595.mp4?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EQUIPMENT AND PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the memories, you'll gain experience and money. Use them to buy new equipment and improve your skills. Some items require a specific level to be used, adding a strategic dimension to your purchases and your progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Otherside Studio</strong>, <strong>The Memory Thieves</strong> offers an innovative and captivating gaming experience, combining exploration, strategy and cooperation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the unique adventure of <strong>The Memory Thieves</strong>, a cooperative multiplayer game where 1 to 4 players take on the role of memory thieves. Explore the mysterious portals of <strong>Ravenwood</strong> Cemetery and steal forgotten treasures while avoiding hidden dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/b15d0776545329cf587c6ca55409103c.poster.avif?t=1753891128\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/b15d0776545329cf587c6ca55409103c.webm?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/b15d0776545329cf587c6ca55409103c.mp4?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative multiplayer</strong>: Play alone or form a team of four thieves to maximise your chances of success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation</strong>: Each memory is procedurally generated, offering a unique experience every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:</strong> An intense challenge where failure is an essential part of learning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bestiary:</strong> A wide variety of enemies, each with their own behaviors and unique threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics and atmosphere</strong>: Enjoy semi-realistic graphics and a heavy, serious atmosphere that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression system</strong>: Gain experience to level up and unlock new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed objects</strong>: Thwart the curses of cursed rooms and objects that can negatively affect players, but which contain treasures of great value.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive soundtrack</strong>: A simple but effective soundtrack that reinforces the mysterious atmosphere of the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HISTORY AND UNIVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena are occurring in <strong>Ravenwood</strong> cemetery, revealing portals that lead to the memories of the dead. Groups of intrepid thieves see this as a unique opportunity to recover priceless treasures. But beware, for these places are well guarded by souls from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/2dd5559028843e19e20126e69a063595.poster.avif?t=1753891128\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/2dd5559028843e19e20126e69a063595.webm?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963720/extras/2dd5559028843e19e20126e69a063595.mp4?t=1753891128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EQUIPMENT AND PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the memories, you'll gain experience and money. Use them to buy new equipment and improve your skills. Some items require a specific level to be used, adding a strategic dimension to your purchases and your progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Otherside Studio</strong>, <strong>The Memory Thieves</strong> offers an innovative and captivating gaming experience, combining exploration, strategy and cooperation.</p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to face a formidable challenge in this cooperative horror game for 1 to 4 players. Explore the Ravenwood cemetery, dive into the memories of the dead, and try to steal their treasures\u2026 all while surviving relentless threats, where a single mistake can be fatal.",
